  skos:note "The r90 demand population (forced-top25-ocel-fanout-meta-pack targets/ + closure-demands/ + replay-demands/ + ontology t01-t25) asserts no head SHAs, carries no head evidence, and never competed; frozen verbatim under runs/r90/ with heads exactly as they were." .
